THE GATHERING.

AMERICAN FORCES HAVE DEVASTATED 2 TROOPS FROM THE 16TH
ARMORED GUARDS IN THE SOUTH EASTERN AREA OF OPERATIONS. 

1ST TROOP'S ORDERS ARE TO PROCEED ALONG AN EASTWARD COURSE 
HEADING TO PRIMARY TARGET ZONE. 1ST TROOP IS TO DESTROY THE 
AMERICAN BUILT SIGNALS INTELLIGENCE/ELECTRONICS WARFARE 
EMPLACEMENT. THESE TARGETS ARE TO INCLUDE ANY AND ALL COMSAT 
ARRAY DISHES AND ACCOMPANYING RELAY BUNKERS. FURTHERMORE, ALL DUG 
IN ENEMY UNITS ARE SANCTIONED. 

2ND TROOP WILL BE AVAILABLE TO ASSIST.
